STEP 1: INTRODUCTION TO MLOps

MLOps (Machine Learning Operations) is a set of practices that
combines Machine Learning, DevOps and Data Engineering to
reliably and efficiently deploy and maintain ML models in
production.

It aims to unify the development (Dev) and operation (Ops) of
ML systems by automating and monitoring every step of ML system
construction, including integration, testing, releasing,
deployment and infrastructure management.

